Violet Oni

Theme palette, documentation, and preview source: Violet Oni contributors.
Wallpaper: generated with OpenAI's built-in image generation tool on
September 7, 2026. The prompts and resampling process are recorded in
artwork/PROMPTS.md and artwork/aftermath/PROMPTS.md. The latter also records
the generated source and text conversion for the ASCII screensaver.
No game screenshot or extracted game asset is included.
The repository's MIT permission applies to contributor-held rights in its
contents, including artwork to the extent such rights exist.

Inspired by Onimusha: Way of the Sword, a Capcom game. The game name and
related third-party marks belong to their respective owners. This theme is
unofficial and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Capcom.

preview.png is a real Omarchy desktop screenshot showing Alacritty and
Neovim with the theme active. The original illustrative preview is preserved
as artwork/preview-concept.png.
screensaver/preview.png is a real 2560 x 1440 capture of the native Omarchy
screensaver displaying the bundled scene on September 7, 2026.

Omarchy generates application styles from its own templates at theme
selection time. Those upstream templates are not copied into this repository.
Yaru-purple is referenced by name; its icon files are not redistributed.
